            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 71198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Öznitelikler ne işe yarar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Etiketlere ek bilgiler eklerler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Öznitelikler bağlantılar oluşturur</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Boş etiketler oluştururlar</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Öznitelikler URL'ler oluşturur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Etiketlere ek bilgiler eklerler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sayfada <code>&lt;a href=\"https://mimo.org\"&gt;Mimo&lt;/a&gt;</code> bulunuyor. <code>href</code>, <code>a</code> etiketi için ne yapar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bağlantı adresini etikete ekler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Etiket adını <code>href</code> olarak değiştirir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sayfada gösterilen metni oluşturur</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>a</code> etiketini kapatır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bağlantı adresini etikete ekler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 71197,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bağlantı tarayıcıda nasıl görünür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Another Famous Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elliot_Page&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Elliot Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Vurgulanmış bir bağlantı olarak <code>Elliot Page</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Elliot Page</code> normal bir bağlantı olarak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Elliot Page</code> vurgulu ama bozuk bir bağlantıyla</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Bağlantı olarak <code>&lt;em&gt;Elliot Page&lt;/em&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Vurgulanmış bir bağlantı olarak <code>Elliot Page</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> ve <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code> etiketlerini kaldırıp metni koruyorsun. <code>Elliot Page</code> nasıl görünür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Another Famous Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elliot_Page&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Elliot Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Vurgulanmış bir bağlantı olarak <code>Elliot Page</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bağlantı olmadan, yalnızca vurgulanmış <code>Elliot Page</code> metni olarak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\">Vurgusuz bir bağlantı olarak <code>Elliot Page</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Görünür bağlantı metni olarak <code>&lt;em&gt;Elliot Page&lt;/em&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Vurgusuz bir bağlantı olarak <code>Elliot Page</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
