            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Düzgün çalışmasını sağlamak için kodu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/r/lisa.html&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Click to visit my website!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;/a&gt;</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 71160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Açılış <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> etiketine doğru özniteliği ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to the Roaring Twenties, rebooted!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://www.1920-30.com/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Take a look at the previous\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Roaring Twenties here! \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>href</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
