            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu görsel etiketindeki <code>width</code> özniteliğini <code>\"300\"</code> olarak ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/taxi.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"300\"</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
