            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 71540,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>height</code> ve <code>width</code> özniteliklerini, yükseklik genişlikten büyük olacak şekilde ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/clawdius.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"href\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"300\"</code>, ardından <code>\"220\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Görsel <code>/img/clawdius.png</code> dosyasını kullanacak ve genişliğinden daha uzun olacak şekilde görsel etiketini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/clawdius.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"href\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"img\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>src</code>, ardından <code>\"300\"</code> ve son olarak <code>\"220\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
